text:排程遭 admission launcher 拒絕，未建立或覆寫任何 order。

```json
{
  "owner": "issue.automatic",
  "status": "refused",
  "invalid": {
    "field": "input",
    "value": "<urlopen error [Errno 8] nodename nor servname provided, or not known>"
  },
  "next": {
    "kind": "input",
    "owner": "supervisor",
    "required": ["execution_envelope"]
  }
}
```

下一步由 supervisor 提供可讀取的 `execution_envelope`；依 `schedule` Skill，不能自行重建或重試歷史提案。
